# [MLS](../wg/mls.html)

## Summary

The Messaging Layer Security (MLS) Working Group met at IETF 127. The session covered updates on core Working Group drafts (`draft-ietf-mls-extensions`, `draft-ietf-mls-targeted-messages`, `draft-ietf-mls-ratchet-tree-options`, and `draft-ietf-mls-virtual-clients`), the status of post-quantum cipher suites currently in IETF Last Call, proposals for performance optimization in large post-quantum groups (SlimMLS), lightweight pairwise communication (opportunistic channels), user-controlled device authorization, and select individual internet-drafts.

