#### Select Individual I-Ds
*Presentation:* [Select Individual I-Ds](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-mls-select-individual-i-ds-00)  
*Presenter:* Rohan Mahy

- **Framed Content TBS Group Context Hash:** Proposes replacing the full `GroupContext` with a cryptographic hash of `GroupContext` inside `FramedContentTBS`. Prevents signing/hashing over thousands of participant URIs per message, alleviating tight memory constraints (e.g., 32 MB limits on iOS push notification extensions).
- **Semiprivate Messages:** Enables targeted message delivery through federated hubs without disclosing payload contents to intermediary path providers.
  - *Session Poll:* *Who has read the semiprivate message I-D?* — yes: 6, no: 10, no_opinion: 2 (total: 36)
  - Mark Atwood confirmed implementation in `mimid`. Cryptography review was requested prior to adoption.
- **Credential by Reference:** Defines a credential wrapper referencing external credentials by type and signature, reducing duplicate credential data in group states.

